# Global npm CLIs — installed automatically by .rc/.zsh-autoinstall
#
# Format:  <package> <binary>
#
# The binary column is what `command -v` should find. It is NOT always
# derivable from the package name — @playwright/cli installs `playwright-cli`,
# and the `neovim` package installs `neovim-node-host` (the `nvim` binary
# itself comes from the Homebrew formula, which is tracked in Brewfile).
#
# Brewfile tracks brew/cask/tap. This tracks the global npm layer, which
# brew bundle cannot see. Adding a line here installs it on every machine
# at next shell start.

cf                              cf
@openai/codex                   codex
@playwright/cli                 playwright-cli
neovim                          neovim-node-host
@earendil-works/pi-coding-agent pi
